@sfbemerk thanks for testing this on TP8.

I merged main into the branch. There was one conflict with #42178 in `memory_pool.py`. After the merge I ran it again on 4x B300 with TP4 + DCP2: GSM8K is 198/200, TPOT at 32K is 7.67 ms, and the unit tests pass.

cc @kpham-sgl @lmyybh

